{"3628050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tamara", "steam_appid": 3628050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5050140], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/07027313e9c43eec2d2cfa86e88ebfa0.poster.avif?t=1787582383\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/07027313e9c43eec2d2cfa86e88ebfa0.webm?t=1787582383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/07027313e9c43eec2d2cfa86e88ebfa0.mp4?t=1787582383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a gme about an elf with guns. You fight monsters and explore places where all sorts of things went wrong. How you got here is not important. Who you are is irrelevant. What matters is the gun in your hand and the path forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world and look out for secrets and traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in slower paced methodical combat based around timing and positioning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid confrontation when necessary. Gear up and come back later</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire new weapons, armor pieces and other useful items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be tactical and smart about managing your resources </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become powerful and face even greater challenges </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and learn hidden systems and secrets </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/a53d9ed52ab47696c6f7e3cc92d46cfb.poster.avif?t=1787582383\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/a53d9ed52ab47696c6f7e3cc92d46cfb.webm?t=1787582383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/a53d9ed52ab47696c6f7e3cc92d46cfb.mp4?t=1787582383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic style of presentation with changing camera angles and dramatic framing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No interruptions from dialogues or cutscenes - Gameplay begins within seconds after starting the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of dark fantasy and cyberpunk setting in a nineties style aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >brutal and colorful cartoon violence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >elves with machineguns, vampires, robots, goblins and skeletons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >some customisation options: selection of color scheme presets for the player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement and combat controls suitable for different input methods: mouse, keyboard and gaming controllers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/07027313e9c43eec2d2cfa86e88ebfa0.poster.avif?t=1787582383\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/07027313e9c43eec2d2cfa86e88ebfa0.webm?t=1787582383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/07027313e9c43eec2d2cfa86e88ebfa0.mp4?t=1787582383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a gme about an elf with guns. You fight monsters and explore places where all sorts of things went wrong. How you got here is not important. Who you are is irrelevant. What matters is the gun in your hand and the path forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world and look out for secrets and traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in slower paced methodical combat based around timing and positioning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid confrontation when necessary. Gear up and come back later</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire new weapons, armor pieces and other useful items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be tactical and smart about managing your resources </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become powerful and face even greater challenges </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and learn hidden systems and secrets </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/a53d9ed52ab47696c6f7e3cc92d46cfb.poster.avif?t=1787582383\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/a53d9ed52ab47696c6f7e3cc92d46cfb.webm?t=1787582383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628050/extras/a53d9ed52ab47696c6f7e3cc92d46cfb.mp4?t=1787582383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic style of presentation with changing camera angles and dramatic framing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No 